{"1153331328":"Anyone who has a roster’s link can see that roster, so share it the way you’d share a family calendar.","2791263553":"Staff collect children at dismissal and walk or drive them to the program.","721ce1406c":"School’s out. Now what?","b4ea78edb2":"Find the after-school programs that work with your child’s school: what runs in the building, who picks up at dismissal, and what’s close enough to walk to.","4b844d0798":"Find your school or a program","9f6c7e2886":"Every district and charter school in the city is in here. If yours isn’t covered yet, you can ask for it.","8a300b908c":"Days off this year, and who’s open","f8f2f6286e":"Or start somewhere else","757c81f1d0":"By program type","3a62dafeaf":"Music, art, sports, plain old aftercare.","8ed176874c":"By neighborhood","754d6bda83":"What’s based near home, and who comes to pick up.","ee9aa9711a":"All neighborhoods","d4678aa638":"By grade","eea904e13c":"Everything that takes your child’s grade.","adcb071d03":"Schools covered so far","0898b0b426":"All schools","57c574f80d":"Schools are added one at a time, because every pickup list has to be checked. Search for yours above and ask for it: the ones parents ask for most go first.","a7d376eed1":"How programs are sorted","19a9b8c07a":"At the school","b78b2d867a":"Runs in the school building or on its grounds. No travel.","c5898fc305":"Picks up","f1536c3517":"Nearby","abbbbdb7e3":"Close to the school, with no pickup we could find. A fit for older children or a second stop.","4ec0a4ca4b":"Every listing is dated and sourced","1a2e23c6b6":"Every listing links to where the information came from and shows the day it was last checked. Nobody pays to be listed. If it saved you an evening of open tabs,","02738a9126":"buy me a coffee.","24463c5f78":"Who built this","a82882c04a":"Josh Silverbauer is a parent of two, with one in the Nebinger catchment. Navigating after-school programs was chaos for him, so he figured it was chaos for everyone else too. His wife Rachael told him to stop complaining and build something. So he built this.","2ded0fc514":"After-school programs in Philadelphia, sorted by the school your child goes to.","06c76a46e4":"Schools","6c51011791":"Ask for your school","ab14d0a7db":"Programs","b8741ed7c0":"All programs, A to Z","3e6c889cad":"Programs by type","3a356e1883":"Programs by neighborhood","a887a34c48":"Days off from school","0d1fc1aeaa":"Suggest a program","d2684e6248":"Write a review","928655b7f0":"Your family","82a8bb5146":"Build your week","6b21fb791a":"About","5e461a2404":"About this site","5b2fc57ac3":"How listings are checked","1862eb688d":"Send a correction","29c269f6e8":"Request a feature","cf01481f62":"Privacy","fd1482eac6":"Buy me a coffee","b7e5078568":"Listings come from each provider’s public pages and are not endorsements. Prices, hours and pickup routes change, so confirm with the provider before you enroll.","ab9dba162b":"{site} is an independent community project. It is not affiliated with the School District of Philadelphia or any provider listed.","c6a087c2ce":"Runs at the school","fe7f975890":"No travel. Children stay in the building or on school grounds.","b94124d4a9":"Picks up from {s}","29124123b4":"Nearby, no pickup found","e6debee5af":"Close to the school, but you or your child would need to get there. Best suited to older children or as a second stop.","7a2b58b28c":"It’s {time} at {school}. Now what?","3efde1b3d3":"Every after-school program we could find that runs at the school, picks children up from {school}, or sits within a short walk. Pick a grade to see what your child can join.","82909c56bf":"Looking for a particular program?","bc2762bf17":"The number under each grade counts programs at the school or with pickup.","883a11e036":"Nothing matches that. Know a program that should be listed?","c85d669959":"Tell us about it.","4e3deb80a9":"Know a program that serves {school} and isn’t here?","ec70686841":"Add it to the list.","1b2b3b5f17":"Checked, and not listing {school} pickup","db866c0163":"Before you enroll","781d95fb05":"Pickup lists change every year, and most providers need a minimum number of children from a school. Ask each one to confirm {school} pickup for the days you need.","d833eb791a":"Ask what happens on early-dismissal days and district days off.","a40b144f44":"City rec centers post each year’s after-school listing late, so call before counting on a price or a spot. Their listings live in the","3a73f7ec9b":"Parks & Rec finder","1e007536e7":"Free, city-funded programs are in the city’s","b0c40867ce":"After School and Summer Program Locator","72e38f81e9":"dismissal","2f364f8eaa":"Search for any district or charter school in Philadelphia. The ones below already have a page; the rest you can ask for.","77687dbe0c":"Find your school","851df1e67a":"Covered so far","776487435b":"Schools are added one at a time, because every pickup list has to be checked. The ones parents ask for most go first.","e936b4be24":"This school isn’t covered yet","9efecb6136":"Search for your school to see whether it has a page.","95bb52faf1":"Want it added?","add5ed2b5e":"Each school takes real checking, so the ones parents ask for most go first. One tap adds your vote.","82d20edb64":"In the meantime","fa9e43a824":"Browse by neighborhood","982d5244f7":"All programs","0bf23c079f":"Know which programs pick up from this school?","b0863e8ad5":"Tell us, and it gets covered faster.","3104cab419":"Look up a school","7176983e9a":"School name","ef4c661463":"This page needs JavaScript. You can also ask for a school with the suggestion form.","adc8cf0be9":"After school, by what they do","898f345800":"Pick the kind of program you’re after. Each list can be narrowed by grade and neighborhood.","b8dd50250a":"A program can sit in more than one group: a rec center is also aftercare, and a school’s clubs may include music and chess.","30c8a0fc9c":"All types","a3b1c7d062":"{type}: after-school programs","a9247873b3":"Every program on this site in this group, with the schools each one serves. Pick a grade to narrow it down.","124a4fcef4":"Clubs a school runs for its own students aren’t in this list. They’re on that school’s page.","417e1c8db7":"Find your school.","fef0c0d418":"Other kinds of program","8a595d097a":"Every program, A to Z","ac075cc0b8":"All {n} after-school programs on this site, across every school. Narrow them by type, grade or neighborhood, then open one for its hours, cost and how to register.","ccb02c7cbf":"Find a program","5dc601f9f5":"To see only what works with your child’s school,","0bca0d8118":"start from your school.","1c1a8a8331":"Or see what’s close to home:","85f1c414ba":"browse by neighborhood.","839ac4f959":"The details","dc36c48813":"Add to your week","004aabe2fa":"Prices, hours and pickup routes change during the year. Confirm with the provider before you enroll.","af2dbd1483":"Which schools it works for","cc668565fb":"Does it serve a school that isn’t shown here?","f0de56f174":"Tell us.","1337e21fd4":"What parents say","b9d6d369f7":"No reviews yet. If your child has been, a few sentences help the next family choose.","5346b4b0e7":"Write the first review","b50d68970d":"Reviews are first-hand notes from parents and caregivers. Each one is read before it’s posted.","587c8b4e59":"After school, by neighborhood","8f3d592f5f":"Start from where you live. Each neighborhood lists the schools there and the programs based there, plus the ones that come to pick up.","1a4b3e864c":"A program is listed where its building is. Many pick up from schools in other neighborhoods, so your school’s page is still the fullest list.","c90125477b":"Don’t see your neighborhood?","07ede3f675":"Tell us which school or program to add.","40e69b8340":"After school in {name}","266ac918e1":"The schools in {name}, the after-school programs based there, and the ones that come to pick up.","bbb2092610":"Schools in {name}","1e419c3218":"Programs based in {name}","c5fc322f8c":"Each one shows the schools it serves. Open it for hours, cost and how to register.","bc2cbd42ce":"Based elsewhere, but they pick up here","59e4b197e5":"These programs are in another neighborhood and collect children from a school in {name}.","32441257e2":"Other neighborhoods","dac2a8fa8c":"No school in {name} is on the site yet.","cb175bd67a":"Ask for yours.","06ac834ec6":"I’m {name}. I built this because sorting out after-school care for my own kid was chaos. If it saved you an evening of open tabs, a coffee is a nice way to say so.","767050dc15":"It goes to me, the person who built and updates this, for the hours spent checking listings and adding schools.","5c81cff8a1":"It’s a thank-you, not a charitable donation, so it isn’t tax-deductible.","54559419a5":"It buys nothing on the site. Listings are free for every provider, and nobody pays to be listed or to be listed higher.","599831ebe7":"Not a coffee person? A correction or a missing program helps just as much.","6d85a0da52":"Send one here.","3da90473e4":"Privacy, in plain English","adcf19af19":"This site is run by one parent. It collects as little as it can. Here is what it does collect, where it goes, and how to have it removed.","f7dd5c66e9":"The short version","8a9c330935":"There are no accounts and no ads, and nothing you send is sold.","963ac55de5":"Your rosters, including any child’s name you type, are saved in your own browser. They are not sent to us.","66b0cd85db":"If you send a suggestion or a review, it arrives as an email to the person who runs the site.","f844260e06":"We use Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity to see how the site is used, so we can fix what’s confusing.","63e8b54c61":"Rosters and children’s names","5c228fe5c0":"A roster lives in the browser you made it in. Clearing your browser’s site data deletes it.","b7dac40b19":"If you save a school as yours, that choice is kept in your own browser too. Our visit counts record that a school was saved, not who saved it.","f4fc9e377c":"A child’s name is optional. If you add one, it stays on your device and appears in the link you choose to share.","049b308e9d":"When a shared roster is opened, the site removes the name from the page address before any analytics loads, and the roster page is set to be hidden in session recordings.","2e3b852749":"If you add a photo to a week card, the card is made in your own browser. The photo is not uploaded, not saved, and gone when you close the page.","7f8f847dc5":"Suggestions, corrections and reviews","6cc5cdc188":"What you type into a form is emailed to the site’s inbox, and a backup copy is kept on our web host in case the email goes missing.","94f7d60f5b":"Your email address is used only to reply to you or to confirm something. It is never published.","0e0b3194ab":"A review that is approved appears on the site with your first name, your child’s school and the month. Nothing else about you is shown.","73569b8eed":"Asking for a school to be covered sends only the school’s name.","b9fb0bfae2":"Please don’t include children’s names or other people’s personal details in what you send.","77a09c8b1d":"Analytics and recordings","44d34909fd":"Google Analytics records which pages are visited and which buttons, filters and searches are used, along with general details such as device type and approximate location. That includes the words typed into the program search box.","c4da07c2ab":"Microsoft Clarity records how pages are used, including heatmaps and replays of scrolling and clicking, to help us improve the site. We have set it to hide form fields and the roster page.","5811b84db9":"Both services use cookies and similar technologies, and Google and Microsoft handle that data under their own privacy terms:","04cb347cfe":"how Google uses information from sites that use its services","664944bb97":"the Microsoft Privacy Statement","6f46e689e8":"You can block both with your browser’s privacy settings or a content blocker, and the site will still work.","abba3c955f":"Like every website, our host keeps standard server logs, which include IP addresses.","bf541a9940":"Links to other sites","79d870e145":"Program websites, registration pages, calendars and Venmo are run by other organizations and have their own privacy practices.","dcf75191c5":"Children","5677caacfb":"This site is written for parents and caregivers. It is not meant to be used by children, and we do not knowingly collect information from them.","e9d0974c5f":"Seeing or removing what you sent","7ef4608c44":"To have a review taken down, or a suggestion and your contact details deleted, email","30beaab727":". Say what you sent and roughly when, and it will be removed.","b149e0bbf0":"Last updated {date}. If this page changes in a way that matters, the date changes with it.","d34fd34411":"One place to see what’s possible after the last bell","f6cc4005b7":"Finding after-school care means checking a dozen websites to learn who picks up from your school, for which grades, until when. {site} puts that on one page per school.","eb164ad365":"Each listing comes from the provider’s own public pages, the school’s site, or city program data. The sources are linked on every card.","3538dbc094":"Every card shows the date it was last checked. When a detail could not be confirmed, the card says so in a yellow note.","168197886b":"A program is marked “picks up” only when a source names the school. Otherwise it is listed as nearby.","e6927cf2fc":"What this site can’t promise","339b87f81a":"A listing is not an endorsement, and nobody pays to appear here.","02366fc9d1":"Prices, hours, openings and pickup routes change during the year. Confirm with the provider before you enroll.","116a91ada2":"{site} is independent. It is not affiliated with the School District of Philadelphia or any provider.","eb84427331":"Corrections, new programs and new schools","ba49970512":"Parents and providers know these programs best. If something is wrong or missing, or you want your school added,","67b96d067d":"use the form","6802c83437":"It helps to include the program, the school, what changed, and a link to where it’s published.","b83c4cdafe":"Reviews","5016c0caf6":"Reviews are first-hand notes from parents and caregivers. Each one is read before it’s posted and shows the reviewer’s first name and school.","98f6814b72":"We don’t post reviews that name children or individual staff, or reviews a program writes about itself.","db5ef27989":"Nobody pays to have a review posted or removed. A provider who thinks a review is wrong can use the form above or the contact address.","b96da3e11a":"Know one we missed?","f360409b86":"Plenty of good programs are off the radar: a church basement, a dance studio that walks kids over, a neighbor who runs a homework club. Tell us and we’ll check it and add it. You can also fix a listing or ask for your school.","7c2fa947f6":"What are you sending?","06a83f5cdf":"The neighborhood helps too, if you know it.","6c52a3d661":"Which school?","1d2a2ff758":"For another school, name it in the details.","699413c233":"Program name","61acb05fb4":"Does it pick up from the school?","5c4698b6e0":"About you","d3f3c1b887":"All optional. Your email is only used to ask a follow-up question about what you sent.","b687c2eb73":"How we handle it.","f175d577f0":"How do you know it?","ab42293e29":"Your name","3fa6f5fb50":"Your email","c4a3b42095":"Send it","51ecc5b21f":"What happens next","28af69d2cd":"Your note lands in a real inbox. A person reads it.","e836e8414a":"We check it against the program’s own information.","0cc1cfc5af":"If it holds up, it goes on the school’s page with its source and the date.","9fce963f8e":"Nothing is published automatically, and nobody pays to be listed.","815ecd6d02":"Got it. Thank you.","b3777a47d8":"We’ll check it against the program’s own information and add it if it holds up.","10b494ae4f":"Back to the schools.","7a304f2967":"What should this site do next?","ece8c308ad":"A missing filter, something confusing, a thing you wish it did. One person builds this, and reads every one.","fbcc6b1a22":"Your idea","93c7452449":"What were you trying to do, and what would have made it easier?","32861acdae":"Your name (optional)","41882a4420":"Your email (optional)","2b9e323f35":"Only used to ask a follow-up question.","5aa549ca95":"Send the idea","2f86a867fa":"Other things you can send","e6595d151a":"A program that’s missing, or a correction","a5839cf3a1":"A school you want covered","7253574d81":"A review of a program your child went to","5bbf44b373":"Ideas get read, and the ones that help the most families get built first.","21bec4e65a":"Back to the start.","b8b650bf6a":"Monday might be martial arts and Thursday the rec center. Plan the term that’s coming, keep a second roster for what your child is doing now, and send either to your partner, a sitter, or the group chat. More than one child? Each gets their own.","7bf39f5748":"The roster needs JavaScript turned on.","edf718ef2e":"Someone shared this week with you","0833e5be5f":"Child’s name","cdd763fac9":"Optional. It shows on the roster you share.","ac858ab685":"Add a program","6209822bd5":"Drag a card by its colored top to move it to another day, or use the day buttons on the card.","32f0ed93d5":"What this roster costs","d956036884":"An estimate from each program’s published prices, for half a school year: 18 weeks of school, or five monthly bills. It leaves out registration fees, deposits, materials, sibling discounts, subsidies and financial aid. Confirm the price with each program before you budget on it.","b0688fdc15":"Link to this roster","f7ce857f48":"Rosters save automatically on this device. The link is the copy you can keep anywhere: anyone who opens it sees this roster, and it’s how you move one to another phone or computer.","14ec1581e9":"Make it a card","ac085f0036":"One picture of the week to text, print, or hand to your child’s teacher, so they know where your child goes each day and who they are.","9c7696a8cb":"Who it’s for (optional)","a18fea4713":"A note (optional)","817e907c3b":"Your child’s photo (optional)","d03e72f9c9":"The photo never leaves this device. The card is made here in your browser, nothing is uploaded, and the photo isn’t saved.","ee82685bf6":"To email it to a teacher, share or save the card, then attach it to a message from your own email.","58c9312de6":"School’s closed. Now what?","7e005461d0":"The days district schools are closed this year, and the listed programs that run a camp or a full day when they are.","a1f2933bbb":"Days off still to come","a6f7c725dd":"These are the School District of Philadelphia’s dates. Open a day to see who has posted a camp for it. A program is named only when its own site lists that date.","8422b24994":"Who runs something when school is closed","1d1ebf179a":"{n} listed programs say they run camps or full days on days off. {m} of them had no dates on their site when we checked, so ask which days they cover.","5266119c26":"Before you count on it","b9eff86fb0":"Expect to drop your child off. Several programs say there is no school pickup on a day school is closed.","939ba83ac9":"A camp day is usually booked and paid for on its own, separate from after-school.","23f3e9d859":"The district’s calendar lists no early-dismissal days for students this year. If your school sends children home early, ask the program what it does.","25eceb785b":"Charter schools keep their own calendars, so their days off can differ from these.","bc3d3a20ad":"Know a program that runs on days off and isn’t here?","5607151fb2":"How did it go?","2ac3b3b289":"A first-hand note from one family helps the next one choose. Every review is read before it’s posted.","ce536c2876":"Which program?","68730f575a":"Your child’s school","83cd624d2e":"Your rating","501c17289a":"Your review","665f7e8d69":"What was pickup like? Homework help? Would you sign up again?","8ee9829c7e":"Your first name","da1f043fb7":"Shown with your review.","2354db7577":"Never shown. Only used if we need to confirm something.","16add200f8":"This is my own experience as a parent or caregiver.","f4cfa14ce9":"Send review","48216a08c6":"House rules","568a415161":"First-hand only. Write about what your own family experienced.","1f0a3f8568":"Be specific and fair. Details help more than adjectives.","3f759500a1":"No names of children or individual staff.","21eeea0c1a":"Programs can’t review themselves.","8382938cc6":"Reviews show your first name and school, and appear after they’ve been read. Nobody pays to have a review posted or removed.","c35f6fbdee":"Thank you. It’s in.","65cb4c318e":"Your review will appear once it’s been read.","7a6310ea7e":"This jawn isn’t here","8e5ad16e04":"The link may be old, or the page moved.","8d980d5757":"Start from the list of schools."}
